<title>USA: El Paso Cty SD 11, Colo., yields 5.60 pct in 2021.</title>
<headline>El Paso Cty SD 11, Colo., yields 5.60 pct in 2021.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc said it priced $99.829 million of El Paso County School District No 11 (Colorado Springs), Colo., general obligation bonds with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2021.</p>
</text>
